-- the applications whose head is a stuck case or eliminator (a function chosen at run time: what
-- it is applied to stays in the code as a value), counted over a code within k levels (the reading
-- passes the code's size, which bounds its depth, so nothing is cut)
bc-head : Code → Word
bc-head (capp f a) = case f of celim d P B x → #1; ccase d B x → #1; _ → #0
bc-head c = #0
